
Run the LoRa32T unit-test bench on a connected ESP32 with:

    pio test -e upesy_wroom_test

Build the test firmware without uploading it with:

    pio test -e upesy_wroom_test --without-uploading

The bench covers frame sizing and airtime, policy and link metrics,
authenticated ACK replay/tamper rejection, and CTR/CBC/GCM encryption.
